        "created_at": "2011-08-15T01:09:11.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>any speculation on what the beef might be between Baron and Legacy?  They look kinda similar…  Maybe Baron is Legacy’s father/brother/half-brother   that would be cool, I think…   Baron doesnt seem to have any super powers,  so my money’s on half-brother  -who didn’t get the powers of the family, and had to rely on his brains, but it never seemed to be good enough.  He   eventually became  twisted and spiteful.    Any other interpretations?</p>",
