        "created_at": "2011-08-15T01:24:45.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Well, the Baron Blade bio should be going up soon, but the short version is that there was a rivalry between the current Baron’s father and the last Legacy that turned lethal, so it’s a feud that spans generations! I’ll let you read the full story when it’s posted!</p>",
