        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/b/8edcca/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2011-08-21T17:43:47.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Baronages pass filially just like the Legacy powers so it makes sense that Barons Blade and Legacy Heroes would have multi-generational conflicts.</p>\n<p>Legacy has a daughter who already has powers (Next Evolution!) - does the current Baron Blade have children? Maybe his infertility is the source of his nihilistic desire to destroy the Earth?</p>",
