        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/adam/{size}/1946_2.png",
        "created_at": "2011-08-21T19:54:26.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Baron Blade actually believes he’ll survive the impact of the moon and become the leader of the remains of humanity. It’s very likely the Baron has sired several offspring, though as of yet, none has a legitimate claim to the title. The Blade line has a very traditional Eastern European royalty mindset, so purity of blood and a customary marriage are important when establishing heirs. I would imagine he would scorn and disown any illegitimate children, should they exist.</p>",
